*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% Evolis Avansia - unofficial macOS CUPS driver
*% Base strings English (ASCII), German translations (UTF-8) below.
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "AVANSIA.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Evolis"
*Product: "(Avansia)"
*ModelName: "Evolis Avansia"
*ShortNickName: "Evolis Avansia"
*NickName: "Evolis Avansia (inoffiziell, CUPS)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Evolis;MDL:Avansia;CMD:AVANSIA;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "2"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsBackSide: Normal
*cupsLanguages: "de"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-raster application/vnd.evolis-avansia 100 /Library/Printers/Evolis/Avansia/Filter/rastertoavansia"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 1/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% CR80 = 85.60 x 53.98 mm. The Avansia prints edge to edge; the filter
*% extends the edge pixels into the bleed area (2048 x 1300 px @ 600 dpi).
*OpenUI *PageSize/Card Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: CR80
*PageSize CR80/CR80 Landscape (85.6 x 54 mm): "<</PageSize[242.65 153.01]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CR80Portrait/CR80 Portrait (54 x 85.6 mm): "<</PageSize[153.01 242.65]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CR80Bleed/CR80 Landscape with Bleed (86.7 x 55 mm): "<</PageSize[245.76 156]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CR80BleedPortrait/CR80 Portrait with Bleed (55 x 86.7 mm): "<</PageSize[156 245.76]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Card Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: CR80
*PageRegion CR80/CR80 Landscape (85.6 x 54 mm): "<</PageSize[242.65 153.01]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CR80Portrait/CR80 Portrait (54 x 85.6 mm): "<</PageSize[153.01 242.65]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CR80Bleed/CR80 Landscape with Bleed (86.7 x 55 mm): "<</PageSize[245.76 156]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CR80BleedPortrait/CR80 Portrait with Bleed (55 x 86.7 mm): "<</PageSize[156 245.76]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: CR80
*ImageableArea CR80: "0 0 242.65 153.01"
*ImageableArea CR80Portrait: "0 0 153.01 242.65"
*ImageableArea CR80Bleed: "0 0 245.76 156"
*ImageableArea CR80BleedPortrait: "0 0 156 245.76"

*DefaultPaperDimension: CR80
*PaperDimension CR80: "242.65 153.01"
*PaperDimension CR80Portrait: "153.01 242.65"
*PaperDimension CR80Bleed: "245.76 156"
*PaperDimension CR80BleedPortrait: "156 245.76"

*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long-Edge (flip portrait card sideways): "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short-Edge (flip landscape card sideways): "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*OpenGroup: Avansia/Avansia

*OpenUI *AvansiaRibbon/Ribbon: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *AvansiaRibbon
*DefaultAvansiaRibbon: YMCK
*AvansiaRibbon YMCK/YMCK: ""
*AvansiaRibbon YMCKK/YMCKK: ""
*CloseUI: *AvansiaRibbon

*OpenUI *AvansiaBlack/Black Panel: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *AvansiaBlack
*DefaultAvansiaBlack: ALLBLACKPOINT
*AvansiaBlack ALLBLACKPOINT/Black pixels on K panel: ""
*AvansiaBlack NOBLACKPOINT/Composite black (YMC): ""
*CloseUI: *AvansiaBlack

*OpenUI *AvansiaSkipBlankBack/Skip blank back side: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *AvansiaSkipBlankBack
*DefaultAvansiaSkipBlankBack: True
*AvansiaSkipBlankBack True/Yes: ""
*AvansiaSkipBlankBack False/No: ""
*CloseUI: *AvansiaSkipBlankBack

*OpenUI *AvansiaFrontRotate/Rotate front side 180 degrees: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *AvansiaFrontRotate
*DefaultAvansiaFrontRotate: False
*AvansiaFrontRotate True/Yes: ""
*AvansiaFrontRotate False/No: ""
*CloseUI: *AvansiaFrontRotate

*OpenUI *AvansiaBackRotate/Rotate back side additional 180 degrees: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *AvansiaBackRotate
*DefaultAvansiaBackRotate: False
*AvansiaBackRotate True/Yes: ""
*AvansiaBackRotate False/No: ""
*CloseUI: *AvansiaBackRotate

*CloseGroup: Avansia

